d incident.\n\nThe incident has also raised questions about the agency's handling of the situation, with some lawmakers suggesting that the agency should have taken more decisive action to address the issue. The Secret Service has defended its actions, saying that it is taking the allegations seriously and is committed to ensuring the safety and security of the president and his family.\n\nOverall, the scandal has highlighted the challenges facing the Secret Service in maintaining the security and integrity of the president and his family, and has raised questions about the agency's ability to balance its duties with the demands of modern politics.",
