iversity takes a strong stance against such behavior to ensure that all students feel safe and respected.\n\nThe investigation is ongoing, and the LSE has promised to take disciplinary action if the allegations are proven true. The incident serves as a reminder of the importance of promoting inclusivity, respect, and tolerance on university campuses.",
